### Market Dashboards API — tool-use demo
# Run each request with the green ▶ button in the gutter (IntelliJ HTTP Client).
# Backend must be running: ./mvnw spring-boot:run (with ANTHROPIC_API_KEY and
# FINNHUB_API_KEY exported). Edit the "prompt" and re-run to see which dashboard
# tool(s) Claude chooses.

### Most shorted only — expect mostShorted populated, the other two empty
POST http://localhost:8080/api/dashboard
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "prompt": "Show me the most shorted stocks."
}

### Day losers only — expect dayLosers populated
POST http://localhost:8080/api/dashboard
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "prompt": "What are today's biggest losers?"
}

### Two dashboards — expect mostShorted + dayLosers (Claude calls two tools in one turn)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/dashboard
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "prompt": "Show me the biggest losers and the most shorted stocks."
}

### All three — expect every dashboard populated
POST http://localhost:8080/api/dashboard
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "prompt": "Give me all the dashboards."
}

### Inferred selection — no tool named; expect short squeeze + losers
POST http://localhost:8080/api/dashboard
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "prompt": "I'm worried about short squeezes and which stocks are tanking today."
}

### Off-topic — expect NO tools called, every list empty (loop breaks immediately)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/dashboard
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "prompt": "What is the capital of France?"
}
